			"notes": "Babric and Ornithe release\n\nOSL is now embedded in both jars, so retrocommands runs standalone on either loader without installing OSL separately.\n\nInternally, retrocommands no longer exports any of its dependencies to mods that depend on it — previously all of OSL, cryonicconfig, starac and retroapi leaked through transitively. Dependency mods are reached by reflection instead.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/matthewperiut/retrocommands/compare/0.7.4...0.7.5"
		},
